  dialogueText: 'Sometimes you simply want to show that you agree or understand.


    In
    Ilokano, ''okay'' can also be used to say ''okay.''


    It is a simple response
    used to acknowledge something or show agreement.


    Listen carefully: okay.


    Now,
    try saying ''okay'' yourself.'
